WEBVTT

00:28.730 --> 00:30.530
<b>Hey, where's this gate thing?</b>

00:30.610 --> 00:32.070
<b>-Up there.
-Huh?</b>

00:36.200 --> 00:38.580
<b>How the hell are we supposed to reach it?</b>

00:38.660 --> 00:40.580
<b>Hey, Nanaue! Let me climb up on you!</b>

00:40.660 --> 00:41.870
<b>No.</b>

00:42.370 --> 00:43.370
<b>Hey.</b>

00:44.250 --> 00:47.580
<b>The back of all your necks are flashing.
Is that a bad sign?</b>

00:47.670 --> 00:50.920
<b>What? Don't just stand there!
You gotta stop these things!</b>

00:51.000 --> 00:52.130
<b>I can't!</b>

00:52.300 --> 00:54.550
<b>I have no control over
whether they get reset or not.</b>

00:54.630 --> 00:55.630
<b>Friggin' hell!</b>

00:55.930 --> 00:58.510
<b>How are we supposed
to reset the timer, then?</b>

00:59.300 --> 01:00.310
<b>You pray.</b>

01:00.600 --> 01:04.140
<b>Pray that the reset signal is
making its way here from the other side.</b>

01:04.230 --> 01:06.060
<b>No goddamn way! You've gotta be kidding!</b>

01:06.140 --> 01:08.060
<b>-Calm down.
-Huh?</b>

01:08.150 --> 01:09.610
<b>Based on my estimate,</b>

01:09.690 --> 01:12.440
<b>we've only got a few seconds left
until all our heads go kaboom.</b>

01:12.530 --> 01:14.650
<b>-What?
-I see.</b>

01:14.740 --> 01:17.780
<b>So, if our heads are still intact
after waiting a few seconds...</b>

01:17.860 --> 01:20.200
<b>it's proof that
the signal is being sent.</b>

01:20.280 --> 01:21.660
<b>Okay, how much longer we got?</b>

01:21.950 --> 01:23.750
<b>Six, five...</b>

01:24.500 --> 01:27.080
<b>-Tell us this shit earlier!
-Four, three...</b>

01:27.620 --> 01:29.420
<b>Two, one...</b>

01:36.510 --> 01:39.760
<b>Guess they didn't just leave us for dead.</b>

01:39.970 --> 01:42.680
<b>Yeah, assuming you
actually know how to count!</b>

01:43.890 --> 01:46.310
<b>Well, that means we're good for now, huh?</b>

01:46.390 --> 01:50.520
<b>Hey, anybody feeling hungry?
I'm craving an egg salad sandwich!</b>

01:52.440 --> 01:54.110
<b>Well, la dee friggin' da.</b>

01:54.400 --> 01:55.900
<b>Stay sharp, people.</b>

01:55.990 --> 01:58.150
<b>That timer needs to be reset
every 72 hours, right?</b>

01:58.660 --> 02:00.490
<b>Don't let it go down to the wire again.</b>

02:00.570 --> 02:03.080
<b>Huh? Like you're one to talk!</b>

02:03.990 --> 02:05.870
<b>The fact they didn't kill you,</b>

02:05.950 --> 02:08.920
<b>means that you're expected
to finish the mission.</b>

02:09.000 --> 02:10.170
<b>Are we clear?</b>

02:10.250 --> 02:12.500
<b>Huh? I dunno what you mean.</b>

02:12.590 --> 02:16.010
<b>The mission to establish and protect
bridgeheads that are meant to serve</b>

02:16.090 --> 02:17.880
<b>-as the framework for resource acquisition
-Ugh.</b>

02:17.970 --> 02:19.260
<b>and research on this world.</b>

02:19.550 --> 02:21.390
<b>Keep in mind that's the only reason why</b>

02:21.470 --> 02:23.970
<b>your heads are still attached
to your necks.</b>

02:25.180 --> 02:27.060
<b>Anyway, for the time being,
our top priority</b>

02:27.140 --> 02:30.100
<b>is to establish a good relationship
with the people of this kingdom.</b>

02:30.190 --> 02:32.360
<b>We'll start by helping to end the war.</b>

02:32.810 --> 02:36.230
<b>If you're saying that we're on a mission
for peace, then consider it done.</b>

02:36.990 --> 02:38.030
<b>Fair enough.</b>

02:38.110 --> 02:40.950
<b>There's nothing worse than a movie
that just ends halfway through.</b>

02:41.030 --> 02:43.240
<b>I guess I'll have to play along.</b>

02:43.700 --> 02:45.660
<b>I don't roll over like a dog for anyone.</b>

02:45.740 --> 02:48.410
<b>But I'm willing to blow off some steam
by kicking the Empire's ass.</b>

02:49.830 --> 02:50.830
<b>Cool.</b>

02:50.920 --> 02:52.630
<b>Shall we get crackin'?</b>

03:17.940 --> 03:19.360
<b>Batter up!</b>

03:29.870 --> 03:30.870
<b>Huh?</b>

03:40.720 --> 03:42.090
<b>Hey! What the hell, man?</b>

03:42.840 --> 03:44.260
<b>Limp-dick.</b>

03:44.340 --> 03:45.390
<b>What?</b>

03:50.600 --> 03:54.520
<b>Dammit!</b>

05:36.670 --> 05:38.830
<b>That won't make more bullets
magically appear, you know.</b>

05:38.920 --> 05:40.420
<b>No friggin' duh!</b>

05:41.500 --> 05:44.300
<b>I've been frugal with 'em so far,
but nothing lasts forever.</b>

05:47.340 --> 05:48.760
<b>"Frugal," you say?</b>

05:52.600 --> 05:54.890
<b>Ah, look! I made a heart!</b>

05:54.970 --> 05:56.020
<b>Ain't it cute?</b>

05:57.810 --> 06:01.060
<b>I'm actually relieved you won't have
access to your dirty weapons anymore.</b>

06:01.150 --> 06:03.530
<b>Huh? Come, say that to my face.</b>

06:04.110 --> 06:07.200
<b>Using a gun is dirty?
What are you, a friggin' caveman?</b>

06:07.280 --> 06:09.070
<b>If you wanna fight fair and square,</b>

06:09.160 --> 06:11.160
<b>then challenge 'em to a duel
with a glove slap or some shit!</b>

06:11.240 --> 06:13.700
<b>-Huh?
-Cut it out, Deadshot.</b>

06:14.330 --> 06:17.710
<b>Sorry. This guy's just an asshole
through and through.</b>

06:18.290 --> 06:20.130
<b>And there's no fixing him.</b>

06:21.500 --> 06:24.880
<b>However, guns are Peacemaker
and Harley's weapon of choice, too.</b>

06:24.960 --> 06:26.260
<b>So this problem affects us all.</b>

06:26.630 --> 06:29.630
<b>Worst-case scenario, we can just arm
ourselves with frying pans or something.</b>

06:29.720 --> 06:31.720
<b>-That'll do the trick.
-Whaddya mean?</b>

06:32.180 --> 06:35.520
<b>Whoever's got the frying pan
is always the strongest in zombie movies.</b>

06:35.600 --> 06:37.390
<b>I'm not seeing any zombies around here.</b>

06:37.480 --> 06:40.020
<b>All I'm saying is that if it can
beat zombies, it can beat anything!</b>

06:40.100 --> 06:41.230
<b>Good grief.</b>

06:41.310 --> 06:43.940
<b>This grand council of idiots won't be
solving our problem anytime soon.</b>

06:44.020 --> 06:45.530
<b>We might be doomed.</b>

06:45.610 --> 06:46.780
<b>Come again?</b>

06:47.940 --> 06:50.070
<b>Well, I have an idea.</b>

06:50.160 --> 06:52.070
<b>-For real?
-Yeah.</b>

06:52.160 --> 06:55.830
<b>I was originally sent here as part
of an advanced team, remember?</b>

06:56.950 --> 06:58.120
<b>You were?</b>

06:58.200 --> 07:00.750
<b>It wasn't important enough
for me to commit to memory.</b>

07:02.630 --> 07:06.760
<b>Well, my advance team didn't crash
when we first arrived here.</b>

07:06.880 --> 07:09.590
<b>Which means our helicopter and gear
should still be in one piece.</b>

07:10.260 --> 07:14.970
<b>Then let's get this show on the road.
I can't do jack shit without any ammo.</b>

07:15.060 --> 07:18.430
<b>Hurry and replenish your supplies.
We'll go ahead without you.</b>

07:18.520 --> 07:20.940
<b>The only problem is
our helicopter landed on a mountain</b>

07:21.020 --> 07:22.190
<b>that's over on the west side.</b>

07:22.270 --> 07:24.310
<b>So we'll have to go back
to the fort first.</b>

07:24.610 --> 07:27.400
<b>Even if we leave now,
we won't get there until nightfall.</b>

07:27.480 --> 07:30.030
<b>Who the hell cares. I need bullets.</b>

07:30.110 --> 07:31.490
<b>So I'm going whether you like it or not.</b>

07:33.950 --> 07:36.790
<b>Hey, can it wait
until after I take a bath?</b>

07:46.090 --> 07:47.210
<b>Hey!</b>

07:47.300 --> 07:49.760
<b>Nobody told me the baths
were so damn far away!</b>

07:50.130 --> 07:52.220
<b>Well, good news. We're almost there.</b>

07:52.880 --> 07:55.300
<b>We'll have to wait until tomorrow morning
to head for the chopper.</b>

07:55.390 --> 07:56.470
<b>This is where we'll stay the night.</b>

07:57.220 --> 08:01.480
<b>I'm going to need my own cottage, please.
And a massage after my bath, too.</b>

08:01.560 --> 08:03.440
<b>Yeah, I'll get right on that.</b>

08:05.230 --> 08:07.110
<b>Huh? You guys came back?</b>

08:07.190 --> 08:10.940
<b>For a bit. Anyways,
I'm freakin' starving!</b>

08:11.030 --> 08:13.530
<b>We're just about to throw a dinner party.</b>

08:14.160 --> 08:15.660
<b>Come and join us.</b>

08:16.370 --> 08:17.450
<b>Huh?</b>

08:17.530 --> 08:18.660
<b>Dinner party?</b>

08:31.260 --> 08:32.590
<b>What's the occasion?</b>

08:32.670 --> 08:34.590
<b>That loud and obnoxious knight</b>

08:34.680 --> 08:37.260
<b>gave us some booze
as a reward for fighting.</b>

08:37.350 --> 08:39.760
<b>Oh? How generous of him.</b>

08:40.770 --> 08:42.600
<b>What the hell brought that on?</b>

08:42.680 --> 08:46.440
<b>Who knows? But booze is booze.
No sense letting it go to waste.</b>

08:46.520 --> 08:48.860
<b>C'mon, boss babe. Have a drink with us.</b>

08:49.440 --> 08:52.240
<b>But, like, doesn't it suck
to catch such a raw deal?</b>

08:52.320 --> 08:55.240
<b>They just dragged you all out here
to fight a war.</b>

08:55.320 --> 08:58.700
<b>Well, it definitely sucked at first,
but not anymore.</b>

08:58.780 --> 08:59.830
<b>Huh?</b>

09:00.330 --> 09:02.410
<b>In exchange for fighting
on the frontlines,</b>

09:02.500 --> 09:04.710
<b>they said we could have
free reign of this place.</b>

09:04.790 --> 09:07.330
<b>They don't care as long as
the Empire doesn't control it.</b>

09:07.670 --> 09:10.340
<b>I figured us villains
would just stay villains,</b>

09:10.420 --> 09:13.970
<b>but it don't feel half-bad to have
the Kingdom depend on us.</b>

09:14.050 --> 09:15.970
<b>Huh? What are you talking about?</b>

09:16.050 --> 09:17.300
<b>Villains are always villains.</b>

09:17.890 --> 09:20.350
<b>Did you guys drink yourselves
stupid or what?</b>

09:20.430 --> 09:23.520
<b>All this just because the Kingdom
showed you a little kindness.</b>

09:23.600 --> 09:25.350
<b>Ignorance really is bliss.</b>

09:32.610 --> 09:33.940
<b>Beanstalk!</b>

09:34.650 --> 09:36.200
<b>What are you laughing about?</b>

09:36.280 --> 09:39.320
<b>Nothing. It just figures you guys
would feel that way.</b>

09:39.910 --> 09:41.120
<b>Whaddya mean?</b>

09:41.200 --> 09:42.700
<b>You're all strong as hell.</b>

09:42.790 --> 09:45.290
<b>That's why you can't relate
to how these other guys feel.</b>

09:45.960 --> 09:48.250
<b>That means you're something special.</b>

09:50.590 --> 09:54.300
<b>No duh, we're special.
Who do you think you're talking to?</b>

10:02.100 --> 10:04.020
<b>Are you sure this is what you want?</b>

10:04.810 --> 10:07.730
<b>Haven't you heard?
Frying pans are the ultimate weapon!</b>

10:09.230 --> 10:11.310
<b>We'll hold down the fort here.</b>

10:11.900 --> 10:14.730
<b>Yes, see to it, my minions!</b>

10:14.820 --> 10:17.400
<b>Villains never bow down to anyone.</b>

10:17.860 --> 10:18.910
<b>Ain't that right?</b>

10:18.990 --> 10:21.370
<b>And we're villains, just like you guys.</b>

10:24.410 --> 10:26.080
<b>Well, off we go!</b>

10:29.580 --> 10:31.290
<b>-Bye!
-Bye-bye.</b>

10:38.470 --> 10:39.970
<b>What is that?</b>

10:45.720 --> 10:47.560
<b>-Shut up. Don't say anything.
-Whoa, whoa. Calm down.</b>

10:47.640 --> 10:48.730
<b>-Screw you!
-There's the mountain.</b>

10:48.810 --> 10:49.980
<b>No, screw you! Stop talking.</b>

10:54.440 --> 10:55.440
<b>Is that a bird?</b>

10:55.820 --> 10:57.570
<b>Let's head for the summit.</b>

11:12.710 --> 11:14.290
<b>Shit, is this for real?</b>

11:16.380 --> 11:18.340
<b>There's a friggin' dragon
using the helicopter for a nest.</b>

11:18.760 --> 11:20.970
<b>So that flying thing was a dragon?</b>

11:21.050 --> 11:22.510
<b>I thought it was a bird.</b>

11:23.010 --> 11:26.560
<b>Of all the places you could've landed,
why would you choose a dragon's nest?</b>

11:26.640 --> 11:29.230
<b>I didn't! I had no idea
there would be dragons here!</b>

11:29.310 --> 11:30.850
<b>And there wasn't enough time to check!</b>

11:31.190 --> 11:32.270
<b>Ah.</b>

11:36.150 --> 11:38.610
<b>Christ. You've gotta be kidding me.</b>

11:38.690 --> 11:42.070
<b>Well, we've got a team
of weaklings with crappy gear.</b>

11:42.160 --> 11:44.410
<b>Not exactly ideal for dragon slaying.</b>

11:44.490 --> 11:48.830
<b>Hold up, isn't slaying the dragon supposed
to happen at the climax of the story?</b>

11:48.910 --> 11:50.160
<b>Like a final boss or whatever.</b>

11:50.250 --> 11:52.620
<b>Hey, somebody grab me a huge-ass crossbow.</b>

11:52.710 --> 11:55.290
<b>I saw them use one to kill a dragon
in "Game of Thrones."</b>

11:56.340 --> 11:59.800
<b>At any rate, the chopper's fully loaded
with weapons and ammo.</b>

11:59.880 --> 12:01.380
<b>We can't just give up and go back now.</b>

12:01.470 --> 12:05.350
<b>Quit telling us what to do.
Look, nobody's chickening out.</b>

12:06.100 --> 12:07.640
<b>-Wittle baby!
-Fine, then.</b>

12:07.970 --> 12:09.470
<b>Looks like I have to step up to the plate.</b>

12:10.100 --> 12:11.390
<b>What are you gonna do?</b>

12:12.270 --> 12:14.060
<b>Just stand back and watch.</b>

12:14.650 --> 12:16.360
<b>Transform!</b>

12:29.410 --> 12:30.700
<b>Wuzzat? A cat?</b>

12:30.790 --> 12:31.830
<b>Gotta be a dog.</b>

12:31.910 --> 12:32.910
<b>Birdie.</b>

12:36.840 --> 12:38.290
<b>Guess we don't have good chemistry.</b>

12:39.550 --> 12:42.170
<b>Some big shot actor you are.
Can't even win over a dragon.</b>

12:42.260 --> 12:43.260
<b>You bastard!</b>

12:43.340 --> 12:46.550
<b>Are you implying I'm some kind of
wannabe who's just hamming it up?</b>

12:46.640 --> 12:47.680
<b>-Damn straight!
-Well, you and your</b>

12:47.760 --> 12:49.010
<b>-Glad we're on the same page!
-broccoli hair can get bent!</b>

12:49.100 --> 12:51.470
<b>-Don't talk to me when you've got
-Listen up! I'm well known for</b>

12:51.560 --> 12:52.730
<b>-stupid squiggles for hair!
-my natural acting performances!</b>

12:52.810 --> 12:54.560
<b>-Oh, shaddup!
-You wouldn't know</b>

12:54.640 --> 12:55.980
<b>-a good performance
-Hey, guys? Now's probably not</b>

12:56.060 --> 12:57.150
<b>-if it hit you in the face!
-the best time to argue.</b>

12:57.230 --> 12:58.400
<b>Shut the hell up already!</b>

12:58.480 --> 12:59.650
<b>Why don't you- Eh?</b>

13:06.910 --> 13:07.950
<b>Oh!</b>

13:08.200 --> 13:09.200
<b>Fantastic!</b>

13:09.660 --> 13:11.160
<b>Now THIS is an Isekai!</b>

13:11.240 --> 13:13.370
<b>No time for your bullshit! Move it!</b>

13:47.950 --> 13:49.120
<b>Uh-oh!</b>

14:09.180 --> 14:10.350
<b>Ta-da!</b>

14:14.100 --> 14:15.520
<b>It's breathing fire at us!</b>

14:15.600 --> 14:16.690
<b>What do we do now?!</b>

14:16.770 --> 14:18.900
<b>Wait, I'll figure out a plan.</b>

14:19.770 --> 14:20.900
<b>Huh?</b>

14:23.320 --> 14:24.360
<b>Nanaue?!</b>

14:27.360 --> 14:28.490
<b>That's different.</b>

14:28.570 --> 14:30.820
<b>Never seen a dragon
go for fish over meat.</b>

14:30.910 --> 14:32.950
<b>Everyone's so health conscious these days.</b>

14:33.030 --> 14:35.750
<b>I can't imagine sharks
are part of a good diet, though.</b>

14:35.830 --> 14:38.620
<b>Stop clowning around! We gotta save him!</b>

14:41.920 --> 14:43.210
<b>Oh, jeez.</b>

14:52.930 --> 14:54.140
<b>Use this chance to get the weapons!</b>

14:55.220 --> 14:56.430
<b>Lets move!</b>

15:02.560 --> 15:03.730
<b>You still had ammo?</b>

15:03.820 --> 15:05.030
<b>Just one shot.</b>

15:07.150 --> 15:09.360
<b>That shark's tenacious as hell.</b>

15:12.070 --> 15:13.280
<b>What the?!</b>

15:21.170 --> 15:22.250
<b>Nana!</b>

15:28.670 --> 15:30.010
<b>Is Nana okay?</b>

15:31.720 --> 15:33.930
<b>Hot!</b>

15:34.010 --> 15:35.430
<b>Oh, thank goodness!</b>

15:35.510 --> 15:37.680
<b>How is he still okay
after getting hit by all that fire?</b>

15:37.770 --> 15:40.810
<b>Looks like he found a way
to avoid becoming a shark steak.</b>

15:42.350 --> 15:44.810
<b>Uh, hey? I think we're in trouble.</b>

15:47.610 --> 15:49.190
<b>Did those flames dry out the mud?</b>

16:04.130 --> 16:05.380
<b>Hey!</b>

16:09.590 --> 16:11.760
<b>Eat this!</b>

16:27.320 --> 16:28.360
<b>Wow.</b>

16:29.070 --> 16:31.530
<b>What'd I tell you?
Frying pans for the win!</b>

16:31.610 --> 16:32.610
<b>-Huh...?
-Huh...?</b>

16:46.380 --> 16:48.420
<b>Hey! Quit dragging your feet!</b>

16:48.500 --> 16:50.090
<b>Give us those damn weapons!</b>

16:51.670 --> 16:52.760
<b>I'm gonna go take a look!</b>

16:52.840 --> 16:54.050
<b>Huh?!</b>

16:55.220 --> 16:56.510
<b>And touchdown!</b>

17:02.850 --> 17:03.890
<b>She's friggin' nuts.</b>

17:05.400 --> 17:07.690
<b>Check it out. Seems nothing got damaged.</b>

17:08.060 --> 17:09.650
<b>Grab whatever we can use.</b>

17:29.670 --> 17:31.170
<b>This could come in handy.</b>

17:31.250 --> 17:33.170
<b>Hey! Shit's getting crazy down there.</b>

17:33.260 --> 17:34.590
<b>-Oh!
-Huh?</b>

17:37.510 --> 17:39.050
<b>That's what I'm talking about!</b>

17:42.390 --> 17:43.640
<b>Get off my ass already!</b>

17:50.610 --> 17:52.280
<b>What the hell's taking them so long?</b>

17:52.400 --> 17:53.740
<b>-Yoo-hoo!
-Huh?</b>

17:55.450 --> 17:58.030
<b>Here, special delivery!</b>

18:03.330 --> 18:04.790
<b>Hey, lizard face!</b>

18:19.640 --> 18:20.720
<b>Now!</b>

18:26.600 --> 18:28.940
<b>Now this is how you kill a dragon.</b>

19:15.730 --> 19:18.740
<b>You do very good job.</b>

19:19.200 --> 19:21.610
<b>Me appreciate it.</b>

19:24.450 --> 19:27.330
<b>What a haul! This is great!</b>

19:27.750 --> 19:28.830
<b>Hey, Peacemaker.</b>

19:29.080 --> 19:31.080
<b>How did you get the dragon to stop?</b>

19:31.880 --> 19:33.420
<b>Oh, I used this.</b>

19:34.040 --> 19:35.210
<b>Is that...?</b>

19:35.750 --> 19:37.460
<b>It's her egg, I'd assume.</b>

19:37.550 --> 19:40.470
<b>I see. No wonder that dragon
was so desperate.</b>

19:40.550 --> 19:42.470
<b>You took her baby as a hostage?</b>

19:42.550 --> 19:44.260
<b>I'll make an omelette next time.</b>

19:44.350 --> 19:47.600
<b>Gimme that frying pan.
I've never tasted dragon egg before.</b>

19:50.190 --> 19:51.600
<b>In your freakin' dreams!</b>

19:51.690 --> 19:53.610
<b>I can't believe you! That's just cruel!</b>

19:56.570 --> 19:58.490
<b>-What are you so mad about?
-Sorry, little eggie.</b>

19:58.570 --> 19:59.570
<b>You're okay now.</b>

20:05.370 --> 20:07.740
<b>Omigosh! So adorbs!</b>

20:08.700 --> 20:10.580
<b>Well, it obviously thinks Harley</b>

20:10.660 --> 20:12.120
<b>-Aw, who's a good boy?
-is its mom now.</b>

20:12.210 --> 20:13.710
<b>Are newborn dragons...</b>

20:13.790 --> 20:14.830
<b>-You are!
-really like baby chicks?</b>

20:14.920 --> 20:17.340
<b>I mean, they're basically birds. Right?</b>

20:18.300 --> 20:20.420
<b>You think I'm your mommy?</b>

20:20.510 --> 20:21.590
<b>-Don't you dare.
-Aww, too cute.</b>

20:21.680 --> 20:23.180
<b>-I'm gonna take you home.
-It's gonna get huge like its mom.</b>

20:23.680 --> 20:25.890
<b>But it's just a cute little guy for now.</b>

20:25.970 --> 20:26.970
<b>Right?</b>

20:27.470 --> 20:28.810
<b>-Who's a good boy?
-Whatever.</b>

20:28.890 --> 20:30.980
<b>Don't come crying to me later.</b>

20:31.060 --> 20:32.940
<b>We gotta give it a name.</b>

20:34.310 --> 20:35.860
<b>How about Arthur?</b>

20:37.400 --> 20:38.530
<b>You like that?</b>

20:38.610 --> 20:39.860
<b>Then, Arthur it is!</b>

20:41.190 --> 20:42.490
<b>My cute, wittle Arthur!</b>

20:42.570 --> 20:45.030
<b>What do baby dragons even eat?</b>

20:45.120 --> 20:46.910
<b>Gotta be fish, right?</b>

20:53.120 --> 20:56.040
<b>Director, this is Rick Flag speaking.
Do you copy?</b>

20:56.790 --> 20:58.710
<b><i>You're still alive, Flag?</i></b>

20:58.800 --> 21:00.170
<b>Yeah, somehow.</b>

21:00.260 --> 21:01.340
<b><i>And what about them?</i></b>

21:01.460 --> 21:03.340
<b>Proceeding with the mission.</b>

21:03.430 --> 21:05.890
<b>I'm currently accompanying
Harley and her group.</b>

21:05.970 --> 21:09.310
<b>As it stands, we've established
an amicable relationship with the kingdom.</b>

21:09.390 --> 21:11.060
<b><i>All right. That's good news.</i></b>

21:11.140 --> 21:12.680
<b><i>Then let's continue with the plan.</i></b>

21:13.270 --> 21:15.400
<b><i>What is the status of the advance team?</i></b>

21:16.350 --> 21:18.270
<b>They've all joined the enemy ranks.</b>

21:18.570 --> 21:19.570
<b><i>I see.</i></b>

21:20.110 --> 21:21.480
<b><i>Then get rid of them.</i></b>

21:23.240 --> 21:24.240
<b>Copy that.</b>

21:30.660 --> 21:32.330
<b>Well? Can you get it running?</b>

21:32.750 --> 21:35.080
<b>Nope. This thing's not going anywhere.</b>

21:35.170 --> 21:37.380
<b>That dragon made
a real goddamn mess of it.</b>

21:37.960 --> 21:39.790
<b>Guess we're going back on foot.</b>

21:40.340 --> 21:42.510
<b>Let's pack up what we need and leave.</b>

21:42.630 --> 21:45.430
<b>We can just come back
for the rest again later.</b>

21:52.390 --> 21:55.100
<b>We won't have to worry about
running out of ammo for awhile.</b>

21:55.190 --> 21:57.900
<b>Don't let it make you trigger happy
or you'll be sorry later.</b>

21:58.360 --> 22:00.980
<b>I'll feed you when we get back, okay?</b>

22:05.570 --> 22:08.870
<b>Hey, did you guys burn some toast?
It smells kinda funny.</b>

22:09.160 --> 22:10.410
<b>That's not good!</b>

22:17.870 --> 22:19.500
<b>What the hell...?</b>

22:20.130 --> 22:22.670
<b>No way. What happened?</b>

22:22.880 --> 22:23.960
<b>Where's Beanstalk and the others?</b>
